  "limitations": [
    "The retained experimental whole-runtime path has not been fully promoted to production. This study uses the existing prepared-monitor API and one isolated solver traversal shortcut.",
    "All full recordings are byte-identical to the retained control. This proves nonregression for recorded channels, not independent complete-network reference accuracy.",
    "Four existing independent small-case profiles pass unchanged. Live device/generator attachment and activation and custom-bus callback order are checked separately.",
    "All reported measurements include residual compilation, recording and binary/recovery exports. Cold trials and kernel microbenchmarks do not qualify the whole-run timing objective.",
    "The reciprocal row-scale trial shows a small, inconsistent kernel-level difference; it is excluded from all whole-run timings.",
    "Failed source-matching/compilation and fixture-classification attempts are retained. The final fixture explicitly exercises a dynamic load rather than the default generator classification."
